VALUES ('22e711c8-0102-5a8b-91f4-b49349c79918', 'bus_department', 'Department', 'A unit of an organisation that groups people, positions, responsibilities and work. Departments are how people are organised day to day. They define reporting lines, budgets and responsibilities. Defined by HR and management; assigned to people and positions; used in reporting and approvals. A department belongs to an Organization (or one of its business units). Code and identity stay stable. Reorganisations are recorded explicitly so earlier reports do not change. The Accounts Payable department of the finance function.', 'table', 'A', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, '31ce19c8-75c4-5d05-a26b-a81332d9449d', 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
