VALUES ('fd752dec-07d7-570e-85f7-e1f79819488b', 'c5820946-cca9-50b4-8c58-4716c9ea86dc', 'e8f18ea2-6da0-5757-8a94-0c850a604fff', 'cd4dea54-825f-567c-bedd-f8e149f09fca', 'Currency', 'Currency denomination shared by the invoice''s monetary values. Defines the monetary denomination of the claim and its calculated totals. Used for accounting, payment allocation, tax, reconciliation, reporting, and credit or debit adjustment. Payment, CreditNote, SupplierCreditNote, or SupplierDebitNote may use another currency only under explicitly governed exchange-rate treatment. Provides the denomination against which invoice amounts, settlement and adjustments are evaluated. Required — the record cannot be saved while this is empty.', 70, 70, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
