VALUES ('1cd34b66-a606-5efb-b3f6-10f9ba8163a6', 'c4879151-d97c-5f16-b081-474640db365e', 'role_type', 'Role Type', 'The kind of role the party plays. Chosen when the role is assigned; decides which specialised record (customer, supplier and so on) is expected. Buys from the organisation. Sells to the organisation. Works for the organisation. A business partner or reseller. Transports goods for the organisation. Acts on behalf of the organisation or its customers. Provides services under a contract. Owns property or a share in the organisation. Provides capital. Any other role. Separate from Party.partyType, which describes whether the participant is a person or organization. Selects the applicable downstream role specialization and business process.', 1053, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 90, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
