VALUES ('56c5df47-e9cb-5f20-b69f-a78454aa1625', 'bus_profit_center', 'Profit Center', 'A responsibility centre used to analyse revenue, cost and profit independently of the legal accounts. A profit centre lets management see how a part of the business performs, such as a product line or region, whatever legal entity or account the money passes through. It supports management reporting only and never rewrites accounting entries. Defined by finance; chosen on transactions and budgets; read by management reports. A profit centre belongs to one organisation. A profit centre is created, used while it is reported on, and left unused when the unit closes. Existing analysis keeps it. The "Northern Region" profit centre reports revenue and cost for all sales and branches in that region.', 'table', 'A', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, '7d480517-18b8-5c3b-9437-77eda3f4d2df', 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
