VALUES ('5d45affb-c111-5927-aa79-90bd5a228da9', '9f6e37ef-c4ec-508b-afb0-bc192c4fa054', '6e540c2c-4cc5-53c0-8b36-6f6fb3cec64f', '116ad2ee-ffb8-5c0c-aeb5-dc12c8dec856', 'Id', 'The immutable identity of the depreciation record or schedule. Used to trace depreciation calculations, accounting periods, revisions, reporting, and financial integrations. Identifies the depreciation record; Asset identifies the resource being measured and the schedule''s parameters determine how depreciation is calculated. Must be unique: a save is rejected if another Asset Depreciation already uses this value.', 10, 10, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
